---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SectionHeading from "../components/ui/SectionHeading.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../data/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${siteConfig.name}`}
  description="Privacy Policy and client image archive confidentiality at Khemzy Studios."
>
  <header class="legal-hero section">
    <div class="container">
      <SectionHeading
        eyebrow="LEGAL & CONFIDENTIALITY"
        title="Privacy Policy"
        description="Last updated: October 2026. How we collect, store, and protect your personal information and private client galleries."
      />
    </div>
  </header>

  <article class="section legal-content-section">
    <div class="container legal-body">
      <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        At Khemzy Studios ("we", "our", or "the Studio"), we treat client privacy and image confidentiality
        with the utmost gravity. This Privacy Policy details the policies governing the collection, usage,
        and protection of personal data and photographic records obtained through our website, communications,
        and studio assignments.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you inquire or commission our services, we may collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Contact details: Full legal name, email address, phone/WhatsApp number, and postal address.</li>
        <li>Event & Session specifics: Ceremony dates, venue locations, timeline schedules, and guest counts.</li>
        <li>Financial details: Billing details and payment receipts (processed via secure banking gateways).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Private Client Galleries & Image Archiving</h2>
      <p>
        Photographs delivered via our digital cloud vaults are password-protected and hosted on encrypted servers.
        Client galleries are never published publicly without explicit consent or execution of an authorized
        portfolio display release.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Third-Party Disclosures</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties. Data is shared exclusively
        with essential production partners (e.g., fine art album printing houses, secure cloud delivery hosts)
        solely for the fulfillment of your photography commission.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Your Rights & Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Clients may request access to, correction of, or deletion of their contact information at any time
        by contacting <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    padding-top: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 8rem);
    background: var(--color-paper);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .legal-content-section {
    background: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .legal-body {
    max-width: 820px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .legal-body h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .legal-body p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .legal-body ul {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .legal-body li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-body a {
    color: var(--color-gold);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
